  "goodToKnow": "Der Nationalspieler (die Nationalspielerin) is an international player, someone who plays for the national team: die Nationalmannschaft. The men's football team is coached by the Bundestrainer and is often called die DFB-Elf; the women's team has won the European Championship eight times. Being nominated for the first time is called das Debüt in der Nationalmannschaft. Lothar Matthäus holds the German record with 150 international caps (Länderspiele)."
